{"4485190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dino Tales", "steam_appid": 4485190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino Tales</strong> is a colourful adventure game where players explore a world of dinosaurs and interactive stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story from your adventures, discover prehistoric creatures, and unlock new tales as you explore exciting environments filled with puzzles, characters, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for younger players and families, Dino Tales combines exploration, storytelling, and playful discovery in a friendly prehistoric world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦖 <strong>Explore a 3D dinosaur world</strong><br>Travel through vibrant prehistoric environments filled with friendly dinosaurs and hidden surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>Create your own stories</strong><br>Build and experience imaginative tales as you interact with characters and environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Simple controls for young players</strong><br>Easy-to-learn gameplay designed to be accessible for children and families.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌎 <strong>Discover new adventures</strong><br>Unlock new dinosaurs as you progress through the game. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dino Tales</strong> is a colourful adventure game where players explore a world of dinosaurs and interactive stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own story from your adventures, discover prehistoric creatures, and unlock new tales as you explore exciting environments filled with puzzles, characters, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for younger players and families, Dino Tales combines exploration, storytelling, and playful discovery in a frien